msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "News Anchor"
msgstr "Presentador de Noticias"

#: dialogs/Menu/MenuWin.dialogue
msgid "Hello folks, how are we doing today."
msgstr "Hola a todos, como se encuentran el dia de hoy?"

#: dialogs/Menu/MenuWin.dialogue
msgid ""
"Thank you very much for choosing us as your primary source of very serious "
"news."
msgstr ""
"Muchas gracias por escogernos como su fuente principal de noticias sumamente "
"serias."

#: dialogs/Menu/MenuWin.dialogue
msgid ""
"What you just watched was special footage of a man that claims to have "
"invented something amazing."
msgstr ""
"Lo que acaban de ver son imágenes inéditas de un hombre que dice haber "
"inventado algo increíble."

#: dialogs/Menu/MenuWin.dialogue
msgid ""
"A device that can turn a simple \"spin\" motion into enough energy to power "
"a whole house."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo que puede convertir un simple movimiento de “rotación” en "
"energía suficiente para una ciudad entera."

#: dialogs/Menu/MenuWin.dialogue
msgid ""
"However, It seems this man has other goals in mind, given that he just "
"granted us exclusive access to never-before-seen footage showing the device "
"being used as a power source for a rather peculiar little machine."
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, parece que este hombre tiene otros objetivos en mente, dado a "
"que nos acaba de dar acceso a un video exclusivo nunca antes visto que "
"muestra el dispositivo siendo usado como fuente de poder para una maquinita "
"muy peculiar."

#: dialogs/Menu/MenuWin.dialogue
msgid ""
"Im told this little guy can [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 "
"connected=0][color=#ffd877] move [/color][/wave][/outline_size] like "
"nobody's business."
msgstr ""
"Me informan que este pequeño puede [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 "
"connected=0][color=#ffd877] moverse [/color][/wave][/outline_size] por todos "
"lados."

#: dialogs/Menu/MenuWin.dialogue
msgid "Anyway folks, see for yourselves."
msgstr "Pero no me tienen que creer a mi gente, véanlo ustedes mismos."

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid "Funny little guy isn't he, folks?"
msgstr "Un pequeño muy curioso, no creen?"

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Sorry to interrupt your enjoyment, but I just got word that our little guy "
"now has a name."
msgstr ""
"Disculpen la interrupción, pero me acaban de informar que nuestro nuevo "
"amigo ahora tiene nombre."

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid "And well, what could be more newsworthy than that, I say?"
msgstr "Y bueno, que podría ser mas importante que eso?"

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"His new name is [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], named after the "
"technology that keeps his little heart beating."
msgstr ""
"Su nombre es [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], nombrado así por la "
"tecnología que mantiene su pequeño corazón latiendo."

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid "Although, he doesn't look that little anymore, as you can see."
msgstr "Aunque, ya no se ve tan pequeño como podrán ver."

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"His creator has told us [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] can now "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#00cc8b]jump[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size] and has a fresh new look."
msgstr ""
"Su creador nos informa que [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 "
"connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] ahora puede "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#00cc8b]saltar[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size] y tiene un estilo nuevo y mejorado."

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid "What a world we live in, huh, folks?"
msgstr "Vaya mundo en el que vivimos eh gente."

#: dialogs/Level1/Level1Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Anyways, place your bets now, people. Will our new friend really get to the "
"top? Let's find out!."
msgstr ""
"Pero bueno, hagan sus apuestas. Puede nuestro nuevo amigo llegar a la cima? "
"Descubrámoslo!"

#: dialogs/Level2/Level2Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size] does it again, folks!"
msgstr ""
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size] lo hace de nuevo damas y caballeros!"

#: dialogs/Level2/Level2Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"It seems our new friend is gaining popularity among our beloved viewers, and "
"both his creator and us are very excited to hear that."
msgstr ""
"Me informan que nuestro nuevo amigo esta ganando popularidad entre nuestros "
"queridos televidentes, y tanto nosotros como su creador estamos muy "
"emocionados de saberlo."

#: dialogs/Level2/Level2Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"However, with any kind of fame, there will always be jealous people, and "
"this is where [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo's[/color][/wave][/outline_size] first major challenge "
"arises."
msgstr ""
"Pero, con cualquier tipo de fama, siempre habrá gente envidiosa, y es aquí "
"donde [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] se enfrentara a su "
"primer grande reto."

#: dialogs/Level2/Level2Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"There's a new robot in town, folks, and its creator says its technology is "
"vastly superior to Spinamo's weak little heart."
msgstr ""
"Hay un nuevo robot en la ciudad señores, y su creador dice que su tecnología "
"es vastamente superior al pequeño corazón de Spinamo."

#: dialogs/Level2/Level2Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Although, from what we can tell, it seems to be a heartless version of our "
"beloved guy."
msgstr ""
"Aunque, por lo que me han informado, solo parece ser una imitación sin "
"corazón."

#: dialogs/Level2/Level2Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"This robot is challenging our friend to a race that will decide who is truly "
"the superior robot. It's all or nothing people."
msgstr ""
"Este robot esta retando a nuestro amigo a una carrera que decidirá quien es "
"realmente el robot superior. Es todo o nada damas y caballeros."

#: dialogs/Level2/Level2Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Can [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] claim victory and prove "
"his opponents wrong? Let's find out!"
msgstr ""
"Podrá [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] reclamar la victoria y "
"probar equivocados a sus oponentes? Descubrámoslo!"

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"A decisive victory for [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], ladies and gentlemen!"
msgstr ""
"Una victoria decisiva para [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 "
"connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], damas y "
"caballeros!"

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"His popularity, heart, and size just keep growing and growing, and we "
"couldn't be happier to keep reporting on it."
msgstr ""
"Su popularidad, corazón y tamaño solo siguen creciendo y creciendo, y no "
"pudiéramos estar mas felices de seguirlo reportando."

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"But anyway, as we all knew, aside from Spinamo's arrival, a beautiful meteor "
"shower was forecast for tonight."
msgstr ""
"Pero bueno, como todos sabíamos, aparte de la llegada de Spinamo, se había "
"pronosticado una hermosa lluvia de meteoritos esta noche."

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"In preparation for this wonderful event, many children took their telescopes "
"out into the yard and lit bonfires so they could spend the whole night "
"stargazing."
msgstr ""
"En preparación para este gran evento, muchos niños sacaron telescopios a su "
"patio y prendieron fogatas para poder pasar toda la noche viendo el cielo."

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"But, since kids will be kids, after watching the stars, they decided to go "
"home, forgetting to put out their campfires, which led to many complaints "
"from neighbors who couldn't sleep because of the light."
msgstr ""
"Pero, los niños siendo niños, después de ver las estrellas, decidieron "
"regresar a sus casas olvidando apagar todas sus fogatas, y esto llevo a "
"muchas quejas por parte de los vecinos, quienes no podían dormir por tanta "
"luz."

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"And who better to solve this problem than the city's new hero, "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size], equipped with [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 "
"freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#e52d40]a new tool[/color][/wave][/outline_size] "
"that can easily put out these annoying campfires with a single "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#e52d40]shot[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size]!"
msgstr ""
"Y quien mejor para resolver este problema que el nuevo héroe de la ciudad, "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size], equipado con [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 "
"freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#e52d40]una nueva herramienta[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size] que puede apagar fácilmente esas molestas fogatas con un solo "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#e52d40]disparo!"
"[/color][/wave][/outline_size]"

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Win.dialogue
msgid "Get comfortable and let's watch our friend get to work!"
msgstr "Pónganse cómodos en casa, y veamos a nuestro amigo trabajar!"

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Lose.dialogue dialogs/Level5/Level5Lose.dialogue
#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Lose.dialogue dialogs/Level8/Level8Lose.dialogue
msgid ""
"[[Ooops, wrong tape folks!|Sorry people, wrong clip!|Sorry again guys!]]"
msgstr ""
"[[Ooops, cinta equivocada!|Disculpen gente, video equivocado!|Disculpen de "
"nuevo amigos!]]"

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Lose.dialogue
msgid "That's just footage of the pre-race warmup."
msgstr "Eso solo era un video del calentamiento antes de la carrera."

#: dialogs/Level3/Level3Lose.dialogue
msgid "All right, let the race begin!"
msgstr "Pero sin mas, que empiece la carrera!"

#: dialogs/Level4/Level4Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"That's [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], winning people's "
"affection by helping them rest easier, knowing that there's someone looking "
"out for them."
msgstr ""
"Ese es [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], ganandose la afección "
"de la gente ayudando a que descansen bien, sabiendo que hay alguien ahí "
"afuera que vela por ellos."

#: dialogs/Level4/Level4Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"But today is a brand-new, sunny day in the city everyone, and an impending "
"heat wave has given all the kids in town a ravenous appetite for ice cream!"
msgstr ""
"Pero el día de hoy es un nuevo y soleado día en la ciudad damas y "
"caballeros, y una ola de calor le ha dado a todos los niños un intenso "
"apetito por helado!"

#: dialogs/Level4/Level4Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"A whole bunch of ice cream trucks have rolled out, but the heat is putting "
"the ice cream at risk, threatening a very sticky and melted future—if it "
"weren't for our hero..."
msgstr ""
"Me informan que un montón de camiones de helado han sido desplegados en la "
"ciudad, pero el calor esta poniendo al helado en riesgo, amenazando con un "
"derretido y pegajoso futuro—si no fuera por nuestro héroe…"

#: dialogs/Level4/Level4Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo!"
"[/color][/wave][/outline_size] Equipped with a [outline_size=10][wave "
"amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#ffffff]new ability[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size] that lets him [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 "
"connected=0][color=#ffffff]aim his icy projectiles[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size] at the trucks to keep them cold."
msgstr ""
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo!"
"[/color][/wave][/outline_size] Equipado con una [outline_size=10][wave "
"amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#ffffff]nueva habilidad[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size] que le permite [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 "
"connected=0][color=#ffffff]apuntar proyectiles helados[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size] a los camiones para mantenerlos fríos."

#: dialogs/Level4/Level4Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"But he'll have to move quickly from side to side, making sure not to let too "
"much time pass so that the next truck doesn't have a chance to cool down, or "
"this could be a huge disappointment for the city's children."
msgstr ""
"Pero tendrá que moverse rápido de lado a lado, asegurándose de no dejar "
"pasar mucho tiempo y que el siguiente camión no pueda calentarse, si no, "
"esto podría ser una gran decepción para todos los niños de la ciudad."

#: dialogs/Level4/Level4Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Let's go, [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo![/color][/wave][/outline_size] We believe in you!"
msgstr ""
"Vamos [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo![/color][/wave][/outline_size] Creemos en ti!"

#: dialogs/Level5/Level5Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"That's our [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo![/color][/wave][/outline_size] The new sensation "
"among all the kids in town."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level5/Level5Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"But listen everyone, we've just received word that there's a new evil robot "
"threatening to burn down the kids' favorite park!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level5/Level5Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"But fear not—our beloved local hero is on the case! He'll have to "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#e52d40]put out "
"the fire[/color][/wave][/outline_size] in the trees within the time limit, "
"and then [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#e52d40]fire a cooling shot at the evil robot[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size]."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level5/Level5Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Researchers say that if this is done correctly three times, he will be able "
"to stop his enemy single-handedly and secure the park."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level5/Level5Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Come on, [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], we know you can do it—"
"save the day and defeat that nasty guy!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level5/Level5Lose.dialogue
msgid ""
"That was just an AI video of what it would look like if our hero weren't "
"fast enough."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level5/Level5Lose.dialogue
msgid "But here's what really happened!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Lose.dialogue
msgid ""
"That was just a clip the evil robot generated of what victory for him might "
"look like."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Lose.dialogue
msgid "However, this is what actually happened!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Amazing, [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo![/color][/wave][/outline_size] The park is safe and "
"open another day for the kids to enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"It seems that after saving all the trees, nature feels more at ease than "
"ever and has decided to start spreading into the city."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"This caused a gigantic tree to grow right in the middle of the city, which "
"all the local cats immediately decided to climb!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Fortunately, [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] was recently equipped "
"with a [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#19baff]grappling hook[/color][/wave][/outline_size], which will "
"allow him to [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#19baff]rescue all the cats in the tree[/color][/wave][/outline_size] "
"so they can return home safe and sound."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level6/Level6Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Is there anything our great and strong hero can't do? Let's keep watching "
"and hope that one day we can be just like him!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Lose.dialogue
msgid "Ooops, wrong tape folks!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Lose.dialogue
msgid "This is the one"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"All cats can rest easy at home today, knowing that [outline_size=10][wave "
"amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size] is the hero of humans, plants, and pets alike!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Nature seems to have returned to normal, and to celebrate, the city decided "
"to bring in a circus full of wonders for everyone to enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"One of the many wonders is getting to meet the great [outline_size=10][wave "
"amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size], who will be outside the circus to greet all the children."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"On top of that, our hero wants to try to prevent one of the worst tragedies "
"that can happen to anyone who visits the circus..."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=15.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#ef604a]ACCIDENTLY LETTING GO OF THEIR BALLOON!!![/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size]"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Good thing our clever friend is always prepared—this time with "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#ef604a]rockets[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size] that let him [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 "
"freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#ef604a]fly[/color][/wave][/outline_size] and "
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#19baff]reach[/"
"color][/wave][/outline_size] all the loose balloons before they touch the "
"clouds!."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level7/Level7Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"For everyone who decided to enjoy the circus from the comfort of their own "
"home, stay with us and let's watch another act of kindness from our dear "
"friend."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level8/Level8Lose.dialogue
msgid "We all know those balloons didn't get away."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level8/Level8Lose.dialogue
msgid "Have a look!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level8/Level8Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"What a fun day today! Completely free of balloon-induced sadness—all thanks "
"to [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], once again."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level8/Level8Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"But seeing all this happiness, the evil inventor couldn't stand it, so he "
"decided to build a new and final robot that threatens to destroy the entire "
"world!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level8/Level8Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"Come on, [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], we know you can save "
"the day by using all your powerful abilities!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level8/Level8Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"You'll have to hit him with all you got! And at the same "
"time[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#e52d40]put "
"out the fireballs[/color][/wave][/outline_size] and [outline_size=10][wave "
"amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#19baff]catch the meteorites[/color][/"
"wave][/outline_size] before they hit Earth."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level8/Level8Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"We're all counting on [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]you[/color][/wave][/outline_size] to save us one last time!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Lose.dialogue
msgid "[[Just kidding!|Got you!|Psyche!]]"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Lose.dialogue
msgid ""
"That's not what really happened, our mighty hero wouldn't let us down like "
"that."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Lose.dialogue
msgid "This is what really happened!"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"[outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=20.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]YOU DID "
"IT SPINAMO![/color][/wave][/outline_size]"
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Win.dialogue
msgid "And to think that just a few days ago, he was so small."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"From this day forward, the planet is in a perpetual state of harmony, free "
"from threat and prepared should any new one arise."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"This was the story of [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0]"
"[color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], our little friend who "
"ended up being of enormous help to everyone."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Win.dialogue
msgid "Remember, whenever you're in need..."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/Level9/Level9Win.dialogue
msgid ""
"There will always be someone in the sky [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 "
"freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]looking out for you.[/color][/wave][/"
"outline_size]"
msgstr ""

